import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 787 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One's Relationship with the Symbiotic Court","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 787 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One's Relationship with the Symbiotic Court","no":787,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Institutions","Symbiotic Court","Judiciary","Equality Before the Law"],"related":["48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism","40-Symbiotic Constitution General Outline","784-Transcended Ones and Institutions Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0787_模块4-制度-超脱者与共生法院.md","filePath":"en/0787_模块4-制度-超脱者与共生法院.md"}`),o={name:"en/0787_模块4-制度-超脱者与共生法院.md"};function r(s,e,d,l,c,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-787-transcended-ones-and-institutions-the-transcended-one-s-relationship-with-the-symbiotic-court" tabindex="-1">Entry 787 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One&#39;s Relationship with the Symbiotic Court <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-787-transcended-ones-and-institutions-the-transcended-one-s-relationship-with-the-symbiotic-court" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 787 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One&#39;s Relationship with the Symbiotic Court&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 48, 40, 784</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-even-the-strongest-must-stand-in-the-dock" tabindex="-1">Introduction: even the strongest must stand in the dock <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-even-the-strongest-must-stand-in-the-dock" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: even the strongest must stand in the dock&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Symbiotic Court is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s judicial body — hearing all cases violating Myriad-Rank law. The old world&#39;s transcended ones never enter court, because he is strongest and courts cannot reach him. Heng Yuan Zhou must squarely answer: <strong>one person strong enough for the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm — can he stand in the dock?</strong> The answer: yes, and must be able to. This entry pins the transcended-one/Symbiotic-Court relationship down.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom requires courts directly judge predatory behavior; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires courts be equal to all Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires judicial fairness serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the judicial process not disturb causality; the law-first axiom requires judicial procedure be self-consistent and not bypassable by any transcended individual.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-transcended-one-s-dual-identity-in-court" tabindex="-1">I. The Transcended One&#39;s Dual Identity in Court <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-transcended-one-s-dual-identity-in-court" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Transcended One&#39;s Dual Identity in Court&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one in the Symbiotic Court has dual identity:</p><ol><li><strong>Citizen identity</strong>: the transcended one, as a Myriad-Rank citizen, is subject to Myriad-Rank law. If he breaks law, the Court hears him;</li><li><strong>Witness identity</strong>: the transcended one, thanks to Alaya Network&#39;s full-record capability, may serve as a fact witness in others&#39; cases providing causal evidence.</li></ol><p>Two identities must not be confused: the transcended one may not avoid prosecution because &quot;I&#39;m a witness,&quot; nor refuse to testify because &quot;I&#39;m a transcended one.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-special-procedure-for-transcended-one-cases" tabindex="-1">II. Special Procedure for Transcended-One Cases <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-special-procedure-for-transcended-one-cases" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Special Procedure for Transcended-One Cases&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transcended-one cases, because the defendant&#39;s destructive power is enormous, have special procedure, but this procedure is <strong>stricter</strong>, not looser:</p><ul><li><strong>Panel escalation</strong>: transcended-one cases must be heard by the highest collegial panel, not a基层 court sole judge;</li><li><strong>Full public</strong>: the entire trial process of transcended-one cases is live-streamed through Alaya Network; all Myriad-Rank beings may attend;</li><li><strong>Superior review</strong>: after first-instance judgment, it must be reviewed by a superior court before taking effect;</li><li><strong>Execution isolation</strong>: after judgment takes effect, the execution phase takes isolation measures, preventing the transcended one from disturbing the plane during execution.</li></ul><p>The special procedure&#39;s logic is: <strong>the transcended one has large destructive power, so trying him must be more cautious, more public, more secure.</strong> Not &quot;transcended-one extra-legal mercy,&quot; but &quot;transcended-one in-law strict trial.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-transcended-one-may-not-interfere-with-the-court" tabindex="-1">III. The Transcended One May Not Interfere with the Court <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-transcended-one-may-not-interfere-with-the-court" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Transcended One May Not Interfere with the Court&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The hardest rule: <strong>the transcended one may not interfere with the Court.</strong></p><ul><li>May not ask for a lighter sentence because &quot;I am strong&quot;;</li><li>May not ask for the case to be dropped because &quot;I did it for your own good&quot;;</li><li>May not ask for a continuance because &quot;I can affect causality.&quot;</li></ul><p>Any act of court interference is itself a new crime — &quot;interfering with judicial independence,&quot; heard by a higher court. This rule ensures the Court is always Myriad Ranks&#39; judicial body, not the transcended one&#39;s private court.</p><h2 id="iv-the-court-s-five-tier-sentencing-for-the-transcended-one" tabindex="-1">IV. The Court&#39;s Five-Tier Sentencing for the Transcended One <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-court-s-five-tier-sentencing-for-the-transcended-one" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Court&#39;s Five-Tier Sentencing for the Transcended One&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Court&#39;s sentencing for the transcended one, by severity, has five tiers:</p><ol><li><strong>Warning</strong>: minor violation; written warning, recorded;</li><li><strong>Compensation</strong>: caused causal damage; compensates the victim party with origin increment;</li><li><strong>Downgrade</strong>: law-anchoring permissions downgraded; part of public computable power reclaimed;</li><li><strong>Suspension</strong>: transcended-one post suspended; suspended-duty investigation;</li><li><strong>Expulsion</strong>: transcended-one qualification canceled; treated as an ordinary citizen.</li></ol><p>Five-tier sentencing ensures the judiciary has teeth, yet has gradation. The transcended one is not &quot;tried and killed in one instance,&quot; but &quot;tier by tier.&quot;</p><p>After judgment there is still the execution problem. Ordinary cultivators not obeying judgment, the Court may force; but if the transcended one refuses compensation and does not accept rotation downgrade, the Symbiotic Court cannot rely on &quot;having a fight&quot; to execute — that equals returning to predation logic. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution is &quot;weight execution&quot;: once a Court judgment takes effect, Alaya Network auto-adjusts the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight, freezes his cross-plane deployment permissions, downgrades his law-anchoring operation level, until he fulfills the judgment. In other words, no one needs to force him; the system will make him &quot;unable to continue.&quot; If he tries to cut off his connection to Alaya Network to evade execution, that itself is a first-degree felony; the Anchor Supervisory Committee will launch a joint investigation. This &quot;rely on the system, not force&quot; execution method is where the Court truly has teeth against the strongest.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the old world letting the strongest evade trial equals letting predatory behavior go unpunished; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the Court to put predators in the dock</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Court directly judges predatory behavior; predatory transcended ones have no place to hide before the law</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is law in his plane; Heng Yuan Zhou requires Tang Luo stand in the dock for trial</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Court has equal jurisdiction over all Myriad-Rank beings; the transcended one may not be an exception</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: transcended-one cases are fully public throughout; full judgment text is opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. Judgment results directly affect his civilizational weight</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Even the strongest must stand in the dock. This is not distrust of the transcended one, but respect for judicial independence. A court that may try even transcended ones is Myriad Ranks&#39; true court. If a court may only try ordinary people, not the strongest, then it is not a court, but a shrine for the weak. The Symbiotic Court&#39;s judgments are not affected by any transcended one&#39;s strength, only by evidence and law — this is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s hardest-ever execution of &quot;equality before the law.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/48-司法体系与裁决机制.html">Entry 48 · Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/40-共生宪法总纲.html">Entry 40 · Symbiotic Constitution General Outline</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/784_模块4-制度-总论.html">Entry 784 · Transcended Ones and Institutions Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/780_模块4-万族-超脱者的监督机制.html">Entry 780 · Transcended One&#39;s Supervision Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
